										<content:encoded><![CDATA[


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Shred rails, fight icons and flee horrors beyond your understanding with the <a href="https://www.playstation.com/ps-plus">PlayStation Plus</a> Monthly Games for December. Tony Hawk’s Pro Skater 3+4, Dragon Ball Xenoverse 2, and Amnesia: The Bunker will be available to all PlayStation Plus members* from Tuesday, December 1 to Monday January 4. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Let’s take a closer look at each of the games.</p>


