<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Last chance to add the PlayStation Plus Monthly Games for November</strong></h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">PlayStation Plus members have until Monday November 30 to add the PlayStation Plus Monthly Games for November &#8211; Dead Island 2, Tomb Raider IV – VI Remastered, Monster Train 2 – to their library.</p>



<p class="has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><em>*PlayStation Plus lineup may differ by region. Please check the</em> <a href="http://playstation.com"><em>PlayStation.com</em></a> <em>for details.&nbsp;</em></p>



<p class="has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><em>**The PS5 version of the game will run native 4K at 60FPS in Fidelity Mode. 4K output requires a 4K compatible device or display.</em></p>
